                "description": "Max number of results per [page](https://dev.frontapp.com/docs/pagination)"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_token",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Token to use to request the [next page](https://dev.frontapp.com/docs/pagination)"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "List the events that occured for a conversation in reverse chronological order (newest first). The order will respect your company's [bump settings](https://help.front.com/t/y729th/customize-when-conversations-bump-up), which determine when conversations bump to the top.\n\nRequired scope: `events:*:read`"
        },
        {
